s os v\u00eddeos"],"Test Connection":["Conex\u00e3o de teste"],"Connection successful":["Conex\u00e3o bem-sucedida"],"Connection failed":["Falha na conex\u00e3o"],"View error":["Visualizar erro"],"<span>You are using Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider <a href='%s' target='_blank'>Upgrading to Pro<\/a><\/span>":["<span>Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 usando a vers\u00e3o Lite do plugin, que n\u00e3o precisa de licen\u00e7a. Aproveite! \ud83d\ude42 Para acessar mais recursos, considere <a href='%s' target='_blank'>atualizar para a vers\u00e3o Pro<\/a><\/span>"],"License Key":["Chave de licen\u00e7a"],"Your license key provides access to updates and support":["Sua chave de licen\u00e7a d\u00e1 acesso a atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es e suporte"],"Your <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> license is %s":["Sua licen\u00e7a do <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> \u00e9 %s"],"<em>Already purchased? Simply enter your license key below to activate YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>":["<em>Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 comprou? Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 digitar sua chave de licen\u00e7a abaixo e ativar o YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>"],"Enter License Key":["Inserir chave da licen\u00e7a"],"Manage License":["Gerenciar licen\u00e7a"],"Enter API Key":["Inserir chave de API"],"Connected YouTube Account":["Conta do YouTube conectada"],"This account is used to display channel feeds. It will not affect playlist, favorites, search, livestreams or single videos stream.":["Esta conta \u00e9 usada para exibir feeds de canais. Isso n\u00e3o afetar\u00e1 a lista de reprodu\u00e7\u00e3o, os favoritos, a pesquisa, as transmiss\u00f5es ao vivo ou a transmiss\u00e3o de v\u00eddeos individuais."],"Feed not working? ":["O feed n\u00e3o est\u00e1 funcionando? "],"Try Re-authenticating connected account":["Tente autenticar novamente a conta conectada"],"API Key":["Chave de API"],"Preserve settings if plugin is removed":["Manter as configura\u00e7\u00f5es caso o plugin seja exclu\u00eddo"],"This will make sure that all of your feeds and settings are still saved even if the plugin is uninstalled":["Isso garantir\u00e1 que todos os seus feeds e configura\u00e7\u00f5es ainda sejam salvos, mesmo se o plugin for desinstalado"],"Import Feed Settings":["Importar configura\u00e7\u00f5es de feed"],"You will need a JSON file previously exported from the Feeds for YouTube Plugin":["Voc\u00ea precisar\u00e1 de um arquivo JSON exportado anteriormente do plugin Feeds for YouTube"],"Export Feed Settings":["Exportar configura\u00e7\u00f5es do feed"],"Select Feed":["Selecione o feed"],"Export":["Exportar"],"Export settings for one or more of your feeds":["Exportar configura\u00e7\u00f5es para um ou mais dos seus feeds"],"Custom Code":["C\u00f3digo personalizado"],"Caching":["Cache"],"1:00":["13:00"],"2:00":["14:00"],"3:00":["3:00"],"4:00":["4:00"],"5:00":["5:00"],"6:00":["6:00"],"7:00":["7:00"],"8:00":["8:00"],"9:00":["9:00"],"10:00":["10:00"],"11:00":["11:00"],"12:00":["12:00"],"Cache cleared successfully.":["Cache limpo com sucesso."],"Couldn't clear the cache.":["N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel limpar o cache."],"Clear All Caches":["Limpar todos os caches"],"Used for showing views. Example: 392k views":["Usado para exibir visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es. Exemplo: 392 mil visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Ago":["Atr\u00e1s"],"Used for showing time. Example: 3d ago":["Usado para exibir o tempo decorrido. Exemplo: 3d atr\u00e1s"],"Used to highlight when a video is streaming live":["Usado para indicar quando um v\u00eddeo est\u00e1 sendo transmitido ao vivo"],"Used to highlight when a video is going to stream live":["Usado para indicar quando um v\u00eddeo ser\u00e1 transmitido ao vivo"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 3 minutes 21 seconds":["Usado para mostrar a dura\u00e7\u00e3o do v\u00eddeo. Exemplo: 3 minutos e 21 segundos"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 1 hour 3 minutes":["Usado para mostrar a dura\u00e7\u00e3o do v\u00eddeo. Exemplo: 1 hora e 3 minutos"],"To display the call to action":["Para exibir a chamada para a\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Thousands":["Milhares"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 321K videos":["Usado no n\u00famero de visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es. Exemplo: 321 mil visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Millions":["Milh\u00f5es"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 4.2M videos":["Usado no n\u00famero de visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es. Exemplo: 4,2 milh\u00f5es de visualiza\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Custom Text\/Translate":["Texto\/tradu\u00e7\u00e3o personalizada"],"Enter custom text for the words below, or translate it into the language you would like to use.":["Digite um texto personalizado para as palavras abaixo ou traduza-o para o idioma desejado."],"Original Text":["Texto original"],"Custom text\/translation":["Texto\/tradu\u00e7\u00e3o personalizada"],"Context":["Contexto"],"AJAX theme loading fix":["Corrigir carregamento de tema do AJAX"],"Usage Tracking":["Monitoramento de uso"],"Cron Clear Cache":["Cron limpar cache"],"If your YouTube feed is not updating, your WordPress installation may have a rare issue with clearing temporary data in your database. Enable this setting to use WordPress cron to clear your feed caches.":["Se o seu feed do YouTube n\u00e3o estiver sendo atualizado, sua instala\u00e7\u00e3o do WordPress pode ter um problema raro com a limpeza de dados tempor\u00e1rios no banco de dados. Ative essa configura\u00e7\u00e3o para usar o cron do WordPress para limpar seus caches de feed."],"Enqueue JavaScript in header":["Enfileirar JavaScript no cabe\u00e7alho"],"Add the JavaScript file for the plugin in the header instead of the footer":["Adicione o arquivo JavaScript para o plugin no cabe\u00e7alho no lugar do rodap\u00e9"],"Disable WP Posts":["Desativar posts do WP"],"This will disable the feature that saves each video as a WordPress post.":["Isso desativar\u00e1 o recurso que salva cada v\u00eddeo como um post do WordPress."],"Save new videos as":["Salvar novos v\u00eddeos como"],"Draft":["Rascunho"],"Publish":["Publicar"],"When you import new videos, they will be saved accordingly":["Quando voc\u00ea importa novos v\u00eddeos, eles ser\u00e3o salvo de acordo"],"Information to Display":["Informa\u00e7\u00f5es a serem exibidas"],"Stats (Like and Comment Count)":["Estat\u00edsticas (n\u00famero de curtidas e coment\u00e1rios)"],"Saved Featured Images":["Imagens em destaque salvas"],"Enabling this feature will automatically download video thumbnails and assign them as the featured image for a video post created using YouTube Feeds. Image files are stored in your WordPress media library.":["A ativa\u00e7\u00e3o desse recurso baixar\u00e1 automaticamente as miniaturas de v\u00eddeo e as atribuir\u00e1 como a imagem em destaque de um post de v\u00eddeo criado usando o YouTube Feeds. Os arquivos de imagem s\u00e3o armazenados na biblioteca de m\u00eddia do WordPress."],"Smash Balloon Team":["Equipe Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Na Smash Balloon, desenvolvemos softwares que ajudam voc\u00ea a criar feeds de m\u00eddia social responsivos para o seu site em minutos."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Nossa miss\u00e3o \u00e9 simplificar ao m\u00e1ximo a inclus\u00e3o de feeds de m\u00eddia social no WordPress. Diga adeus a etapas de configura\u00e7\u00e3o complicadas, widgets de iframe sem gra\u00e7a ou taxas negativas de velocidade de p\u00e1gina."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Nossos plugins n\u00e3o s\u00e3o apenas f\u00e1ceis de usar, mas tamb\u00e9m totalmente personaliz\u00e1veis, confi\u00e1veis \u200b\u200be r\u00e1pidos! \u00c9 por isso que mais de 1,6 milh\u00e3o de usu\u00e1rios incr\u00edveis, assim como voc\u00ea, escolheram us\u00e1-los em seus sites."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Nossos outros plugins de feed de m\u00eddia social"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugins recomendados"],"Search Documentation":["Pesquisar documenta\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Need more support? We\u2019re here to help.":["Precisa de suporte adicional? Estamos aqui para ajudar."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Enviar uma solicita\u00e7\u00e3o de suporte"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Nossa equipe de suporte r\u00e1pida e amig\u00e1vel est\u00e1 sempre feliz em ajudar!"],"System Info":["Informa\u00e7\u00f5es do sistema"],"Collapse":["Recolher"],"Expand":["Expandir"],"Export Settings":["Exportar configura\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Compartilhe facilmente as configura\u00e7\u00f5es do seu plugin com o suporte"],"Getting Started":["Primeiros passos"],"Some helpful resources to get you started":["Alguns recursos \u00fateis para voc\u00ea come\u00e7ar"],"More help getting started":["Mais ajuda para come\u00e7ar"],"Docs & Troubleshooting":["Documentos e resolu\u00e7\u00e3o de problemas"],"Run into an issue? Check out our help docs.":["Teve um problema? Consultar nossos documentos de ajuda."],"View Documentation":["Ver documenta\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Additional Resources":["Recursos adicionais"],"To help you get the most out of the plugin":["Para ajudar voc\u00ea a aproveitar ao m\u00e1ximo o plugin"],"View Blog":["Acessar blog"],"Creating Your First YouTube Feed":[""],"How do I Find a Channel ID?":[""],"Guide to Creating and Using an API Key":[""],"How do I Embed a Feed Into a Template Directly?":[""],"My Feed is Showing Unlisted Videos":[""],"Can I Change When the Video Plays?":[""],"How Does the Plugin Optimize Page Load Time?":[""],"Troubleshooting 'YouTube Data API has not been used in project'":[""],"Will Feeds For YouTube Work with Caching Plugins?":[""],"Enter or Paste API Key":[""],"Learn more about how to create and add an API Key here":[""],"Connect with an Access Token":[""],"Reviews":[""],"WPChat":[""],"Install WPChat and connect with customers on WhatsApp, Messenger, Telegram & Instagram and more":[""],"WPConsent":[""],"Detect all the plugins that use cookies and sets a consent banner in just a few clicks. Works well with Smash Balloon plugins.":[""],"TikTok":[""],"Convert videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Recheck license":[""],"Congratulations! You have upgraded to Youtube Feed ":[""],"Please update the plugin by clicking the button on the right for changes to take effect":[""],"Update Plugin":[""],"The plugin will be updated to a newer version":[""],"You might want to backup your website before updating the plugin":[""],"Update Anyway":[""],"Entered API Key is invalid. You can double check the API Key or learn more about generating them <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>here<\/a>":[""],"API Key is used to fetch from the YouTube API, and is required for several features to work. <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>Learn more<\/a>":[""],"No requests will be made to third-party websites. To accommodate this, some features of the plugin will be limited.":[""],"The plugin will function as normal and load videos directly from YouTube.":[""],"detected":[""],"No GDPR consent plugin detected. Install a compatible <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/feeds-for-youtube-gdpr-compliance\/?youtube' target='_blank'>GDPR consent plugin<\/a>, or manually enable the setting to display a GDPR compliant version of the feed to all visitors.":[""],"Activate WPConsent":[""],"Install WPConsent":[""],"Activate WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Install WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Manage cookie and privacy preference features from a single place. Smash Balloon plugins work great with WPConsent.":[""],"Installing...":[""],"This helps us prevent plugin and theme conflicts by sending a report in the background once per week about your settings and relevant site stats. It does not send sensitive information like access tokens, email addresses, or user info. This will not affect your site performance as well. <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-feed\/docs\/usage-tracking\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=usage-tracking' target='_blank'>Learn More<\/a>":[""],"The default HTML for the feed can be replaced with custom templates added to your theme's folder. Enable this setting to use these templates. See <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/guide-to-creating-custom-templates\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=custom-templates' target='_blank'>this guide<\/a>.":[""],"Setup":[""],"Let us setup your plugin!":[""],"Bring the power of YouTube videos directly to your site! With an easy setup, you'll have your first feed ready to go in minutes.":[""],"Launch the Setup Wizard":[""],"Welcome Image":[""],"Step":[""],"Exit Setup":[""],"1":[""],"Set up YouTube plugin ":[""],"To be able to fetch your YouTube videos we need a YouTube API key or a connected YouTube account.":[""],"Skip this step":[""],"Add API Key":[""],"Create all feed types (playlist and live streams)":[""],"Display video statistics, comments, and more":[""],"Fetch complete video history":[""],"Learn how to get a YouTube API Key":[""],"OR":[""],"Connect a YouTube account":[""],"Display 20+ videos from any channel":[""],"Cannot fetch playlists, live streams etc.":[""],"Cannot display likes and comments":[""],"Cannot filter out private videos":[""],"Connect YouTube Account Manually":[""],"Cannot connect a YouTube account from the plugin? Generate an access token from our website in a click and paste it below.":[""],"Paste Access Token here":[""],"Access Token entered is not valid":[""],"Generate Access Token":[""],"Add an API Key for YouTube":[""],"For optimal performance, reliability, and to use all feed types and features you will want to enter an API key. It is free to create and only takes a few minutes.":[""],"API key entered is not valid":[""],"API Key added successfully!":[""],"Your access token is added and now you should be able to add any YouTube feeds. You can update and delete it from Settings.":[""],"Okay":[""],"2":[""],"Configure features":[""],"YouTube channel feeds":[""],"Create and edit YouTube feeds":[""],"Downtime Prevention":[""],"Automatically prevents any downtime by cleverly using cache storage":[""],"Video player":[""],"Social Feed Collection":[""],"Install Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok plugins":[""],"Installs Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok feeds plugins":[""],"Install Reviews Feed and display customer reviews and an overall rating from Google or Yelp.":[""],"Installs Reviews Feed Plugin":[""],"Installs WPChat Plugin":[""],"Pro Features":[""],"Display playlists, live streams and comments":[""],"Show custom playlists, your live streams and video comments":[""],"Show custom end of video action":[""],"Display a customised call to action when a video ends":[""],"Convert Videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Copy all of your videos into WordPress custom posts":[""],"You might also be interested in...":[""],"Enable your favorite features and disable the ones you don\u2019t need":[""],"Install Selected Plugins":[""],"Activate a GDPR plugin":[""],"Install a GDPR plugin":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by activating a plugin today.":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by installing a plugin today.":[""],"Activate Selected Plugin":[""],"Install Selected Plugin":[""],"WPConsent activated":[""],"WPConsent installed":[""],"Why should I install a GDPR plugin?":[""],"Legal Compliance":[""],"Ensure your website complies with GDPR and other privacy regulations.":[""],"Build Trust":[""],"Show visitors you respect their privacy with transparent cookie consent.":[""],"Easy Management":[""],"Simplify cookie consent and privacy compliance with automated tools.":[""],"Upgrade to Unlock playlists, livestreams, custom actions and much more":[""],"To unlock these features and much more, upgrade to Pro and enter your license key below.":[""],"Upgrade to YouTube Feed Pro":[""],"Upgrade today and ":[""],"(auto-applied at checkout)":[""],"Awesome. You are all set up!":[""],"Here\u2019s an overview of everything that is setup":[""],"Complete Setup Without Upgrading":[""],"Installing":[""],"We\u2019re more than just an Youtube plugin!":[""],"Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":[""]}}}